{start_of_verse}
Tum ho toh subah hai
Tum ho toh shaam
Tum ho toh har lamha
Lagta hai inaam
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Na chaand chahiye, na taare
Bas tum raho kinaare
Na chaand chahiye, na taare
Bas tum raho kinaare
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
Bheed mein bhi tanha tha main
Tumne haath thaama
Ab har gali mein geet hai
Har mod pe afsaana
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Na chaand chahiye, na taare
Bas tum raho kinaare
Na chaand chahiye, na taare
Bas tum raho kinaare
{end_of_chorus}
